    <description>1/9/26 - [RFS23-11976] Change Status in Get User Affiliations to &quot;Does not equal Former&quot; to improve retrieval of Affiliations.
5/30/25 - [RFS23-9160] - Added accounts affiliated to the user to allowed list. 

Get details about the user, their contact, and account. Separated from other flows for better security.

4/3/25 - [RFS23-8954] Fix issue with contacts not loading properly for the Ship To contact in the modal. Fixed the decision path for when the flow is run by an internal user VS a portal user so that the correct contacts/users are referenced for identifying the contacts to show.

12/31/24 - Add variables to support use by internal Amplify users.

3/26 - Get Accounts and Child Accounts - No longer getting affiliations.
4/1 - updated to pass collection of Account IDs instead of string value of IDs.</description>
